OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US opposes the UK imposing
OL,8,Fsanctions. The US ambassador to Israel,
OL,9,FMike Huckabee, tells the BBC that US
OL,10,Fstates could retaliate against the UK
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
