OL,3,AHarry and Meghan 'surprised' by King's
OL,4,Aletter making clear they remain
OL,5,Anon-working royals
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the Duke and Duchess
OL,8,Fof Sussex says they were surprised to
OL,9,Fsee the Royal Household had sent out a
OL,10,Fletter clarifying the official status
OL,11,Fof Harry and Meghan as non-working
OL,12,Froyals.
OL,14,FThe spokesperson said the pair "were a
OL,15,Flittle surprised not to have been told
OL,16,Fabout this in advance."
OL,18,FBut royal sources say Harry and Meghan
OL,19,Fwere made aware of the letter before it
OL,20,Fwas made public.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
